<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AX 뉴스 다이제스트 · {{ date }}</title>
<style>
  :root { --bg:#f4f5f7; --card:#fff; --ink:#15233b; --muted:#5b6b85;
          --accent:#2563eb; --line:#e3e7ee; --navy:#0f1b2d; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
         font-family:'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','Noto Sans KR',system-ui,sans-serif;
         line-height:1.6; }
  a { color:inherit; }
  header { background:var(--navy); color:#fff; padding:28px 20px 20px; }
  header .wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; }
  header h1 { margin:0; font-size:22px; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  header .sub { margin-top:6px; color:#9fb0cc; font-size:14px; }
  nav.dates { background:var(--navy); padding:0 20px 18px; }
  nav.dates .wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; gap:8px;
                    overflow-x:auto; padding-bottom:4px; }
  nav.dates a { flex:none; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px;
                text-decoration:none; background:#1d2c44; color:#aebbd2; }
  nav.dates a.on { background:var(--accent); color:#fff; font-weight:600; }
  nav.dates a.home { background:transparent; border:1px solid #34425f; }
  main { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:30px 20px 10px; }
  section.topic { margin-bottom:34px; }
  section.topic > h2 { font-size:17px; margin:0 0 14px;
                       padding-bottom:8px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--line); }
  .grid { display:grid; gap:16px;
          grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(290px,1fr)); }
  .card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px;
          overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
          transition:box-shadow .15s,transform .15s; }
  .card:hover { box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,27,45,.12); transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .thumb { display:block; aspect-ratio:16/9; background:
           linear-gradient(135deg,#dfe5ef,#c6d0e2); overflow:hidden; }
  .thumb img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
  .body { padding:14px 16px 16px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; flex:1; }
  .title { font-weight:700; font-size:15px; text-decoration:none;
           letter-spacing:-.01em; color:var(--ink); }
  .title:hover { color:var(--accent); }
  .summary { margin:0; font-size:13.5px; color:#374863; white-space:pre-line; flex:1; }
  .meta { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;
          margin-top:4px; }
  .src { background:#eef1f6; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:6px; }
  .read { margin-left:auto; color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; }
  section.feedback { max-width:1180px; margin:10px auto 0; padding:24px 20px 0; }
  .fb-card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px;
             padding:22px; }
  .fb-card h2 { margin:0 0 6px; font-size:17px; }
  .fb-card p { margin:0 0 14px; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
  .fb-btn { display:inline-block; background:var(--accent); color:#fff;
            text-decoration:none; padding:9px 18px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600;
            font-size:14px; }
  .fb-embed { margin-top:16px; width:100%; height:680px; border:1px solid var(--line);
              border-radius:8px; }
  footer { max-width:1180px; margin:30px auto; padding:20px; color:var(--muted);
           font-size:12.5px; text-align:center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>📰 AX 뉴스 다이제스트</h1>
    <div class="sub">{{ date }} · 오늘 수신한 기사 {{ count }}건 · AI / AX / Agent 트렌드</div>
  </div>
</header>
<nav class="dates">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="home" href="index.html">전체 ▾</a>
    {% for d in all_dates %}
      <a href="{{ d }}.html" class="{{ 'on' if d == date else '' }}">{{ d }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
  {% for g in groups %}
  <section class="topic">
    <h2>{{ g.label }} <span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;">{{ g.articles|length }}</span></h2>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for a in g.articles %}
      <article class="card">
        <a class="thumb" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {% if a.thumbnail %}<img src="{{ a.thumbnail }}" loading="lazy" alt=""
               onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}
        </a>
        <div class="body">
          <a class="title" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ a.title }}</a>
          <p class="summary">{{ a.summary or a.raw_excerpt }}</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="src">{{ a.source }}</span>
            <a class="read" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">원문 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% else %}
  <p style="color:var(--muted);">이 날짜에는 수집된 기사가 없습니다.</p>
  {% endfor %}
</main>

<section class="feedback">
  <div class="fb-card">
    <h2>💬 이 뉴스봇, 어떻게 개선하면 좋을까요?</h2>
    {% if feedback_ready %}
    <p>주제·소스·요약 형식 등 개선 아이디어를 자유롭게 남겨주세요. 팀의 의견이 다음 업데이트에 반영됩니다.</p>
    <a class="fb-btn" href="{{ feedback_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">의견 보내기 (새 창)</a>
    <iframe class="fb-embed"
            src="{{ feedback_url }}{{ '&' if '?' in feedback_url else '?' }}embedded=true"
            title="개선 의견 폼" loading="lazy">로드 중…</iframe>
    {% else %}
    <p>관리자가 <code>config.yaml</code> 의 <code>feedback_form_url</code> 에 Google Form 주소를
       입력하면 여기에 의견 수집 폼이 표시됩니다.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  AX 뉴스봇 · 매일 오전 9시 자동 발행 · 데이터 출처는 각 기사 원문 매체에 있습니다.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
